  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save Wildlife, Save People w/ Conservation Wells</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through investments to refurbish broken water wells in rural Malawi, this project seeks to save and enhance thousands of people&apos;s lives and while contributing to elephant and wildlife conservation efforts. Refurbishing water wells profoundly transforms people&apos;s lives by improving their health, creating economic opportunities, and enabling the pursuit of education. This will also help save elephant lives by reducing conflict between people and wildlife created by the search for water and income.</narrative>
  </description>
